UKGC moves to target illegal gambling operators' funds and assets

The UK Gambling Commission said it will go after the money and assets behind black-market operators, announced during Illegal Gambling Awareness Week (9–13 November). In 2025/26 it referred 397,527 URLs to search engines, with 266,667 removed, yet 586 illegal sites were still accessible in September 2026. Its survey found 0.6% of respondents used an illegal site in the past four weeks.

